- `:numericValue` (data property) – for the numeric value of a rate (e.g., 0.15). Domain `:TrafficClassSpecification`, range `xsd:decimal`.
- `:unit` (data property) – for the unit of a rate (e.g., "Mbps"). Domain `:TrafficClassSpecification`, range `xsd:string`.

